# The desktop browser floors below mirror core/SupportedBrowser.php: browsers at or below the
# versions listed there are served a NotSupportedBrowserException, so every desktop browser Matomo
# actually renders the reporting UI for is covered by the CoreVue polyfill. Keep the two in sync.
# Vue 3 additionally requires native ES2015 (including Proxy), which cannot be polyfilled, so older
# engines cannot run the UI regardless. Mobile families are not gated by SupportedBrowser and are
# kept from their first native-ES2015 release. This list only decides which core-js polyfills the
# shared CoreVue polyfill bundle ships (see plugins/CoreVue/polyfills).
chrome >= 49
firefox >= 52
safari >= 11
edge >= 18
opera >= 73
ios_saf >= 10
samsung >= 5
not dead
